<div class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="sm:flex sm:items-center">
    <div class="sm:flex-auto">
      <h1 class="text-base font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900">Relatórios e Exportações</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700">Baixe planilhas CSV consolidadas para analisar desempenho em ferramentas externas como Excel ou PowerBI.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- Card Estudantes -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow ring-1 ring-black ring-opacity-5">
      <div class="px-4 py-5 sm:p-6">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900">Relatório de Estudantes</h3>
        <div class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm text-gray-500">
          <p>Exporta todos os estudantes cadastrados contendo dados demográficos, status da conta e a pontuação total atingida.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5">
          <%= link_to students_admin_reports_path(format: :csv), data: { turbo: false }, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" do %>
            <svg class="-ml-0.5 mr-1.5 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5M16.5 12L12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3" />
            </svg>
            Baixar CSV (Estudantes)
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card Temas -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow ring-1 ring-black ring-opacity-5">
      <div class="px-4 py-5 sm:p-6">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900">Desempenho por Tópico</h3>
        <div class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm text-gray-500">
          <p>Agrupa as respostas e exibe a taxa de acerto global para cada Tópico cadastrado na plataforma.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5">
          <%= link_to themes_admin_reports_path(format: :csv), data: { turbo: false }, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" do %>
            <svg class="-ml-0.5 mr-1.5 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75V16.5M16.5 12L12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3" />
            </svg>
            Baixar CSV (Tópicos)
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
